<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten feed products unchanged.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten feed products unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. corn gluten feed pellets and soymeal prices were unchanged Monday. Cash sources reported active inquiries into gluten feed pellet prices in Chicago.</p>
